__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/
output/
output_*/
# pytest transient temp roots from CLI/runtime contract suites (large, not evidence)
.pytest-tmp/
.pytest-tmp-*/
# Canary workspaces under novels/tier0-*-canary/ are pinned production
# evidence: their output/artifacts are force-added despite the output/ rule
# above. Git still tracks them once staged. Do not delete the force-added
# audit/extend/compose canary artifacts in docs/00_project/releases/.
*.bak
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/settings.json
.arts/
.codeartsdoer/
input_short.txt
input.txt
.ai-memory/
.taskflow/
# A1 canary 运行证据与基准 refs（base state/frames/smoke policy/setup manifest）——
# doc 48 §5：Provider profile、策略、基准、真实调用审计与 Canary 证据一律留在 gitignored 本地证据目录
runtime/
# 临时调试/全量日志（非证据），不入库
.debug_*
.calibrate_real.log
.full_suite*.txt
.agent-broker/
# 具体小说信息（标题/正文/工作区/证据源）一律不入 GitHub——GitHub 仅保留工具框架与风格库积累
novels/*/
!novels/tier0-*-canary/
# 真实小说 canary 输入（章节正文/证据源）不入库；仅保留 tier0 合成样本
canary_inputs/*
!canary_inputs/tier0_*
# 本地私密备份（小说正文/证据源），仅存本机
.private_backup/
# 参考原文样章（版权文本/读者提供文本，用于 style 提炼等），一律不入 GitHub
reference_texts/
# Local reusable Author instances; contains corpus-derived evidence and stays private
author_models/
supervision/
